<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="PaLTM5.4.10">
<l>taṭavaraivāy miḷirntumiṉṉun tavaḷane ṭuṅkoṭipōl</l>
<l>cuṭaroḷiyāy neñciṉuḷḷē tōṉṟumeṉ cōtinampi</l>
<l>vaṭataṭamum vaikuntamum matiḷtuva rāpatiyum</l>
<l>iṭavakaika ḷikaḻntiṭṭeṉpā liṭavakai koṇṭaṉaiyē</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>Like a tall white banner that glitters and shines on a broad mountain,</l>
<l>my splendorous Lord</l>
<l rend="indent"> who appears inside [my] heart as a brilliant light,</l>
<l>forgetting [your] homes on the northern mountain,</l>
<l rend="indent">in Vaikunta, and in the walled city of Dvāraka,</l>
<l>you have taken [your] home in me.</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
